print_wavo_post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF2'
wavo setup:

  Launch it and, on the phone, open WhatsApp > Linked devices > Link a
  device, then point the camera at the code (or link with your phone
  number instead). The chats sync to a local archive on the first link.

  Keep your desktop keyring unlocked so WAVO can open its encrypted
  archive. On Linux this needs a Secret Service provider (GNOME Keyring
  or KeePassXC with Secret Service enabled).

  Colour emoji have a bundled fallback; GIFs play in the app.

Docs: https://wavo.rocks
EOF2
}

post_install() {
  print_wavo_post_install
}

post_upgrade() {
  print_wavo_post_install
}
